# Learn: the first lesson (Set a stone: land three slabs) completed with the
# keyboard's Enter (a Drop key too): the lesson toast, then Escape pauses and
# Leave round shows the results. Waits from `node tools/perfect-plan.mjs t1 3`.
until 300 Learn
frames 5
click Learn
until 60 Set a stone
frames 5
save learn-setup
click Set a stone
frames 243
key Enter 2
frames 233
key Enter 2
frames 312
key Enter 2
until 60 Lesson complete: Set a stone
save lesson-done
frames 5
key Escape 2
until 60 Leave round
frames 5
click Leave round
until 120 Round over
